# Sideways information passing (issue 809), OPTIONAL with a FILTER in the group (over the group's variable): gold medals only.
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
PREFIX foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/>
PREFIX dbo: <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/>
PREFIX dbp: <http://dbpedia.org/property/>
PREFIX wso: <http://wallscope.co.uk/ontology/olympics/>
PREFIX wsr: <http://wallscope.co.uk/resource/olympics/>
SELECT ?i ?m WHERE { ?i wso:games <http://wallscope.co.uk/resource/olympics/games/1896/Summer> OPTIONAL { ?i wso:medal ?m FILTER(?m = <http://wallscope.co.uk/resource/olympics/medal/Gold>) } }
